    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49475" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῠραυλ-έω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλή</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>live in the open air, camp
				out</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				272a
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				695a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
